title: "Machine learning surrogates for flash flood hazard mapping: CSI-optimized feature selection and spatial transferability"
abstract: >-
  Code and datasets accompanying the article evaluating Random Forest,
  eXtreme Gradient Boosting, and a Feed-Forward Neural Network as surrogates
  for high-resolution 2D hydrodynamic flood simulation, with CSI-optimised
  feature selection and cross-catchment spatial transfer (Argens to Gapeau).
